WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:07.710
The average lavatory seat is much cleaner
than the average toothbrush.

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:18.880
Your teeth are home to 10,000 million bacteria
per square centimetre.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:31.780
20% of people believe they have a food allergy,
but only 2% actually do.

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:38.480
The American secret service tried to spike
Hitler's carrots with female hormones to change

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:39.490
him into a woman.

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:40.500
Every human has spent about half an hour as
a single cell.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:48.470
Bruce Lee was so fast that they had to slow
the film down so you could see his moves.

00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:59.350
Cows eat only grass but have 25,000 taste
buds: two and a half times as many as humans.

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:04.559
The CIA reads up to 5 million tweets a day.

00:01:04.559 --> 00:01:12.710
The average American absorbs 34 GB of information
a day, though half of it is obtained from

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:15.649
playing video games.

00:01:15.649 --> 00:01:21.860
If all the asteroids in the Solar System were
lumped together, they'd be smaller than the

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:23.069
Moon.

00:01:23.069 --> 00:01:28.569
Because there is no weather on the Moon, the
footprints of the 12 men who walked on it

00:01:28.569 --> 00:01:30.939
are still there.

00:01:30.939 --> 00:01:41.170
Google earns $20 billion a year from advertising,
more than the primetime revenues of CBS, NBC,

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:44.590
ABC and FOX combined.

00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:51.209
Angel Falls, in Venezuela, is 17 times higher
than Niagara.

00:01:51.209 --> 00:01:58.439
Venus rotates so slowly on its axis that its
day is longer than its year

00:01:58.439 --> 00:02:05.299
The entire Internet weighs about the same
as one large strawberry.

00:02:05.299 --> 00:02:09.899
Barley has twice as many genes as people.

00:02:09.899 --> 00:02:13.990
More than 50% of koalas have chlamydia.

00:02:13.990 --> 00:02:22.270
Some parts of Antarctica have had no rain
or snow for 2 million years.

00:02:22.270 --> 00:02:29.980
Melbourne used to be called Batmania.

